Dear Xao,

A   function that does that is:

find1<- function(x,y)

{       nx<-nchar(x)

        f1<-1;
f2<-1; aux<-NA

        while(f1
>=0){

                f1<-regexpr(y,
substring(x, f2, nx))

                aux<-c(aux,
f1)

                f2<-
f2 + f1

        }

cumsum(aux[-c(1,length(aux))])

}

Best wishes,

Mario

               

 

