Dear Andries,

A function that does that is:

find1<-

function(X, b1 = 0, b2 = 200)

{

        s1 <- 1:(length(X) - 1)

        s2 <- s1 + 1

        res1 <- s1[X[s1] > b1 & X[s2] > b2][1]

        c(res1, res1 + 1)

}

Best wishes, Mario

